From 172685a46be2142abc9b108069b02f09e06af69b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:08:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(2d): clear wide bores with concentric rings

Walk outward at each level and share the bounded floor reach plan with detection.
Use the blind cutter flat to prevent interior bull-nose floor ridges.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1566
